BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (The Lumen LF-60 is an inline optical-correlation flow meter for clean and lightly loaded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (liquids in general industrial, building services and water distribution applications. A pulsed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (LED light sheet passes through two sapphire windows in the measuring tube, and the electronics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (cross-correlate the particle and micro-bubble patterns seen by two receivers to calculate flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (velocity. With no moving parts and no obstruction in the bore, the LF-60 produces negligible) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (pressure loss and needs no routine recalibration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (The LF-60 is the standard-pressure member of the Lumen family. It is rated PN16 \(16 bar\) and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (suits pipe sizes from DN25 to DN200. For higher pressures, higher fluid temperatures, HART) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (communication or IP67 installations, specify the LF-60P.) Tj ET
